      "key": "cq_coverage",
      "value": {
            "CQ1": "Invoice instances are linked to Message via containsMessage; Message hasSegments including LIN_Segment (via LineItem), with segment group and containment reflecting D96A. All invoices listed as Invoice instances within the Message.",
            "CQ2": "Invoice hasOrganization property linking to Organization; Organization instances involved in an invoice are thus obtained; NAD_Segment and related segment groups provide participant details.",
            "CQ3": "OrganizationRoleAssignment (pivot class) links Organization to AgentRole (Buyer, Supplier, DeliveryParty, etc.) for a given Invoice; AgentRoleAssignment is reified for role context.",
            "CQ4": "AgentRole subclass Buyer; OrganizationRoleAssignment with playsRole Buyer identifies the buyer organization for an invoice.",
            "CQ5": "Organization class with hasAddress, hasGLN, and other properties; Address class for different address types; NAD_Segment and segment groups detail involved organizations.",
            "CQ6": "Organization with AgentRoleAssignment as Buyer; hasAddress property gives buyer's address; NAD_Segment specifies address context.",
            "CQ7": "LineItem class linked to Item via hasItem; LIN_Segment anchors line items; PIA_Segment provides additional item identification; segment groups and packaging segments included.",
            "CQ8": "Item class with properties (e.g., description, identifier); LineItem hasNetPrice, hasQuantity; IMD_Segment provides item description; PRI_Segment provides price details; segment groups included.",
            "CQ9": "LineItem hasNetPrice property (xsd:decimal); PRI_Segment provides net price; MOA_Segment provides monetary breakdowns at both line and summary; TAX_Segment for taxes.",
            "CQ10": "HeaderSection, DetailSection, SummarySection classes structure the invoice details; properties like hasInvoiceNumber, hasDate (DTM_Segment), hasReferenceNumber (RFF_Segment), DOC_Segment for document details, segment groups for references, taxes, allowances/charges.",
            "CQ11": "SummarySection hasInvoiceAmount property (xsd:decimal); MOA_Segment provides total amount; TAX_Segment and ALC_Segment provide tax and charge details; CNT_Segment for totals.",
            "CQ12": "HeaderSection hasInvoiceNumber property (xsd:string); BGM_Segment and RFF_Segment provide invoice number context; segment groups for references.",
            "CQ13": "Ontology structure reflects EDIFACT D96A requirements; all mandatory segments, segment groups, and business-required segments (contacts, transport, delivery terms) included; SHACL constraints (out of scope) would validate required fields.",
            "CQ14": "Invoice hasBusinessProcess property linking to BusinessProcess class, allowing assignment to a process."
      }
}
